SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1793953082
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMet chief warns policing 'heading for
OL,4,Afailure' without reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe changes would replace the 43-force
OL,7,Fstructure with three tiers: local teams
OL,8,Fdealing with neighbourhood issues,
OL,9,Fregional forces sharing specialist
OL,10,Fresources and a National Police Service
OL,11,Ftackling the most serious crimes.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
