OL,3,A'Misleading' student loans information
OL,4,Aleft out examples of higher-salary
OL,5,Arepayments
OL,6,
OL,7,FSeveral universities in England have
OL,8,Fonly been using below-average salaries
OL,9,Fin examples of student loan repayments
OL,10,Fon their websites, the BBC has found.
OL,12,FTreasury Committee chair Dame Meg
OL,13,FHillier, who led a recent inquiry into
OL,14,Fstudent loans, said some information
OL,15,Fabout repayments was "misleading",
OL,16,Fincluding one instance where they were
OL,17,Fcompared to the "cost of a daily
OL,18,Fcoffee".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
