OL,3,AWhite House denies Hegseth and Rubio to
OL,4,Aleave jobs after Republican election
OL,5,Alosses
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe White House has denied rumours that
OL,8,FDefence Secretary Pete Hegseth and
OL,9,FSecretary of State Marco Rubio might
OL,10,Fleave their jobs in a post-election
OL,11,Fshakeup of the Trump administration.
OL,13,FUS media have reported there are calls
OL,14,Fto replace Hegseth - in particular over
OL,15,Fhis handling of the Iran war, which is
OL,16,Fbeing blamed for heavy Republican
OL,17,Felection losses.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
