OL,3,ATrump signs order to preserve Oval
OL,4,AOffice as national monument
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has signed an
OL,7,Fexecutive order that he says will
OL,8,Fprevent future presidents from making
OL,9,Fcertain changes to the White House Oval
OL,10,FOffice.
OL,12,FThe executive order declares the
OL,13,Fpresident's official office, which he
OL,14,Fhas renovated, to be a national
OL,15,Fmonument.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
